msgstr ""
"`https://test-edi-api.kontur.ru <https://test-edi-api.kontur.ru>`_ - test"
" Kontur.EDI."

#: ../../integration/EDI_integration/events_kontur.rst:40
msgid ""
"`https://courier-demo-api.esphere.ru <https://courier-demo-"
